cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference Histogram+ in research, reports, or recommendations, please cite it as below."
title: "Histogram+ — Power BI custom visual for distributions with Cp/Cpk, sigma level, DPMO, and Anderson-Darling normality test"
abstract: "Open-source Microsoft Power BI custom visual for statistical histograms. Adds manual bin control, frequency-weighted binning, normal-curve overlay, LSL/USL specification limits with target line, process-capability indices (Cp, Cpk), sigma level + DPMO, the Anderson-Darling normality p-value, quantile-quantile plot overlay, box-and-whisker strip, and configurable mean/median/SD reference lines. Localized in English, Dutch, German, French, Spanish, and Simplified Chinese. Runs entirely inside the Power BI sandbox with no external network access."
authors:
  - name: "MKO Contracting"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mkocontracting/histogram-plus"
url: "https://github.com/mkocontracting/histogram-plus#readme"
keywords:
